# The image people open: a shell, its text tools, the terminal, curl, amy, ps
# and the page's file exchange.
# It holds no compiler; amy installs what a session needs, and nena enables
# the host modules a package needs beyond these (nena@0).
INSTALL /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-core a433a9f4024790ee856ca1c2c5d154005bae59071b822ea80b906d76bb08e7b6
INSTALL /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-posix f148c656a163f0f8c57d6fb861cc047660f8958dc73a02f8dda32fd6b8e49e99
INSTALL /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-display 67fe7a1bafabcb0dfb42d21f69d281ed8d838959cd64554a98976abe6dd79645
INSTALL /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-curl 7c31b5e78ea31d991b867b28a6d53b1179fd095441bcb306d576118c9b0f3b0d
INSTALL /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-amy f53a62d1fd19756ca0d8d8a31190667cfeab02d9a2b2eb1302c0621f74afc308
INSTALL /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-nena 3a0f6be3df60da0e61a9dcf7f1210230529919bddd1e94cd63bcc0d9afb35f83
INSTALL /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-transfer 092d9965a3ee0f87c30411bdf6072691f19e67a617eb0c6fe9d160c3101c5935
